<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on Taiwan chip packaging basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Taiwan chip packaging basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Wednesday it issued 20 million composite call warrants on shares of a basket of three Taiwan chip packaging stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Advanced Semiconductor Engineering Inc   0.4535 shrs</p>
<p> Siliconware Precision			  0.4386 shrs</p>
<p> Orient Semicon				   0.5602 shrs</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 US$3.73	 PREMIUM	 14.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  US$0.5334     GEARING	 6.99x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   05.SEP.97     PAYDATE	 26.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING		LUXEMBOURG    LISTING DATE  26.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     US$3.73	 EXER LOT	10</p>
<p> NOTE		   CASH SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
